OL,3,GNEWSAPreparing for disaster - 'it's a
OL,4,Away of life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA self-confessed "prepper" who
OL,7,Fstockpiles food and supplies in case of
OL,8,Fdisaster, says people who mocked him
OL,9,Fjust two years ago are now appreciating
OL,10,Fwhat he does, after government advice
OL,11,Fto stock around three days worth of
OL,12,Ffood and water.
OL,14,FDad-of-two Mike Chappell, from Burnley,
OL,15,FLancashire, has food, water and
OL,16,Fnon-mains energy sources to last him
OL,17,Fand his family for 90 days in case of a
OL,18,Fdisaster.
OL,20,FHe said the government's advice was "a
OL,21,Fgood starting point" but he would
OL,22,Frecommend no less than 30 days' supply.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
